  "limitations": [
    "Formalizes only the panic 0x11 revert impact; protocol DoS and persistent failure are separate impacts not covered here.",
    "Whether balance_ reduction actually occurs before the call in any real instance is not established.",
    "Formalizes only the protocol-wide reward-distribution failure (i_protocol_dos); the separate underflow revert impact i_revert_panic_0x11 and persistent-failure impact i_persistent_failure are not covered by this plan.",
    "The condition is the report's conditional underflow scenario; no concrete observed transaction is established.",
    "The liveness obligation is formalized for the conditional scenario where balance_ < lastUnderlyingBalance after a DeFi-mechanism reduction; the report does not establish that this state occurs in any real instance.",
    "The persistence of failure across subsequent calls is represented by the single-call completion obligation; per-call repetition is not separately encoded.",
    "The underflow revert (panic 0x11) is treated as the mechanism producing the selected liveness impact, not as a separate formalized impact in this plan."
  ]
